<header class="page-hero">
  <h1>Help more pilots see traffic and be seen</h1>
  <p class="page-hero-subtitle">Spotting another aircraft by eye isn&rsquo;t always easy. Go&rsquo;s radar shows you where to look. Go also transmits your position in ADS-L. Pilots with equipment that can receive it can spot you more easily.</p>
  <p><%= link_to_page "see-and-avoid", label: "Understand the limits of see and avoid" %></p>
</header>

<section id="pledge" class="band band--tint">
  <h2 class="section-title">Keep safety features within reach</h2>
  <p>skyBlip software runs on off-the-shelf hardware. For recreational flying and air sports, position transmissions, traffic reception and alerts stay free, with no subscription. That pledge also covers future ground relays. The code is open. Anyone can read it, check it and help improve it.</p>
</section>

<section id="thanks" class="band">
